    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/7b1aed56c310c85c3b86fb89a890d06b.avif?t=1755669448\" width=336 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a young witch who summons eight mystical guardians to forge an ultimate magic squad! Feel the exhilaration of overwhelming monstrous hordes with tactical swarm strategies! Melee protectors shield you in close combat while ranged allies flood the battlefield with dazzling barrages. Witness eight layers of attack effects converging in explosive synergy, instantly setting the entire battlefield ablaze with magical fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/d55ff7dd9a25f2f58d8f81d80334f691.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/3ed89ce95749aedf1b242e2afff1ba12.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/3ed89ce95749aedf1b242e2afff1ba12.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/3ed89ce95749aedf1b242e2afff1ba12.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/bcfdcbaf59ed897de90257d0a9d57302.avif?t=1755669448\" width=336 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Guardian's power is determined by their equipped position! Dual skills toggle based on gear placement! Seamlessly shift combat styles - execute precision sniping or unleash area-clearing devastation, mastering two tactical dimensions in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/5062d61f7e1d5af2096dfd889a464247.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/5062d61f7e1d5af2096dfd889a464247.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/5062d61f7e1d5af2096dfd889a464247.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/2c092baf59150e4ebcf800551ff30f71.avif?t=1755669448\" width=336 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duplicated Guardian Envoys can be upgraded via Star Ascension or synthesized to explore higher-tier forms: ? &quot;Cute Little Rabbits&quot; + ? = &quot;Lunar Deity Rabbit&quot; summoning a giant full moon! Craft your Mythic-tier Guardian Corps through 500+ evolution paths! Discover Orange-tier Divine Guardian Envoys!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/b95c91230cac73c7a615b1d1809315db.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/b95c91230cac73c7a615b1d1809315db.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/b95c91230cac73c7a615b1d1809315db.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/61c5c54a0792e3c20e4bc6f87481e860.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/61c5c54a0792e3c20e4bc6f87481e860.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/61c5c54a0792e3c20e4bc6f87481e860.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/a5bf5c157590628c96efe0402490d8e6.avif?t=1755669448\" width=336 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match brings fresh mystic eggs stocked in the shop! Invest gold to hatch them, with chances to unleash high-tier celestial guardians! Complete the Codex to unlock 150+ wondrous protectors brimming with arcane power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/c3e86f7f4d5538c1ae4bee0765378661.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/c3e86f7f4d5538c1ae4bee0765378661.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/c3e86f7f4d5538c1ae4bee0765378661.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/e64bb79b845b16cadefe8cc7eb49c7da.poster.avif?t=1755669448\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/e64bb79b845b16cadefe8cc7eb49c7da.webm?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/e64bb79b845b16cadefe8cc7eb49c7da.mp4?t=1755669448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
